<!--
  ⭐ NAMING RULES (SPEC.md section 1 / master-plan section 6.3)
  These strings are a Google Play compliance surface, not just copy.
  FORBIDDEN anywhere in this file: "AI Enhance", "AI Restore", "AI Generator",
  "AI Avatar", "AI Colorize", "AI Retouch", "AI Beauty", "AI Photo Studio".
  Classical image processing must be named classically. "AI" may appear ONLY
  where a real ML Kit model runs, and only with a precise qualifier.
  Also forbidden: any claim of "guaranteed" ID-photo acceptance.
-->
