    <!-- Naming rule: this tool is classical image processing. Calling it "AI
         Enhance" or "AI Restore" is what gets apps rejected and swept under
         Play's AI & deception policy. Keep it "Photo Enhance". -->
    <string name="enh_honest">Photo Enhance uses classical algorithms — auto levels, grey-world white balance, unsharp masking and edge-preserving denoise. It improves exposure and sharpness; it cannot recover detail that was never captured, and it does not restore damaged old photos.</string>

